            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It is an expected and documented behavior, yes. As those do not show Git's stdout, but act as a `GIT_EDITOR`.\r\n\r\nCould you please elaborate on the actual problem this is causing?",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">It is an expected and documented behavior, yes. As those do not show Git's stdout, but act as a <code class=\"notranslate\">GIT_EDITOR</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Could you please elaborate on the actual problem this is causing?</p>",
            "bodyText": "It is an expected and documented behavior, yes. As those do not show Git's stdout, but act as a GIT_EDITOR.\nCould you please elaborate on the actual problem this is causing?",
